!!Dictionaries
* [http://www.lojban.org/jbovlaste/|jbovlaste] is the semi-official Lojban dictionary creation and search utility. Here, you can also generate and download a printable dictionary.
* If you have a dict client, you can set it to www.lojban.org, port 2628. Dict clients allow you to quickly look up the definition of a word. For Linux, try kdict or gdict (usually installed by default). For windows, have a look at [http://www.dict.org/links.html].

!!Official Word Lists
!!!cmavo
* [http://www.lojban.org/publications/wordlists/cmavo.txt|alphabet order]
* [http://www.lojban.org/publications/wordlists/cmavo_selmaho_order.txt|in selma'o order]

!!!gismu
* [http://www.lojban.org/publications/wordlists/gismu.txt|alphabet order]
* [http://www.lojban.org/publications/wordlists/gismu_english_order.txt|English keyword order]
* [http://www.lojban.org/publications/wordlists/oblique_keywords.txt|keywords for non-x1 gismu places]
* [http://www.lojban.org/publications/wordlists/oldlog.txt|mapping to old Loglan "prims"]
* [http://www.lojban.org/publications/wordlists/roget.txt|Roget's thesaurus codes]
* [http://www.lojban.org/publications/wordlists/gismu_spanish.txt|alphabet order with Spanish translations]
* ((Format of Gismu Lists))

!!!lujvo
